      "source_text": "她在复出战的重赏上展现强大，\n拿下了胜利。不拘常理的跑法，\n如今依然健在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bea7483e59c8409defb59316ed18e2a140e528eeee277c2152d0873244d47da2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
